## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design tenant-aware, low-latency reads with isolation and DR in a multi-region Aurora setup.

## Key Concepts

- Per-tenant replication and endpoints
- RLS or schema isolation
- Cache invalidation strategies
- Lag monitoring and failover testing
- Cross-region IAM and network security

## Code Example

```javascript
// Latency probe skeleton
async function measure(url){
  const t0 = Date.now();
  await fetch(url);
  return Date.now() - t0;
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

